    "assistant_markdown": "Edits made\n\n- Changed the card from an Instant to a Creature (types: Creature).\n- Gave it a subtype (Wizard) and added power/toughness (1/1).\n- Converted the instant's modal counter text into a triggered ETB\n  ability so the choices remain meaningful when the card is a creature.\n\nRationale\n\nKeeping the original modal options preserves the card’s design intent.\nMaking it an enter-the-battlefield triggered ability mirrors how the\ninstant’s one-shot effect would behave when the card is a permanent (the\nability goes on the stack when the creature enters). A 1/1 for {U} is a\nsimple, low-cost body that doesn't overshadow the counter ability.\n\nIf you prefer a different subtype, a different P/T, or an activated\nability (e.g., tap to choose one), I can adjust accordingly.\n",
